    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buried Cargo</strong> is a first-person automation game where you interact with the world entirely through a terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone maintenance robot waking up inside a buried shipping container, deep beneath the remains of a forgotten civilization. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use realistic terminal commands to connect to conveyor units, printers, extractors, and scanners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up production lines, expand your small base, and unlock blueprints buried in layers of broken tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own automation network from the inside out, not through a cluttered UI, but with a clean, readable command line.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Scrap Mining:</strong>\u00a0Forget ore veins, every scrap block hides a random mix of materials. Extract what you need, burn the rest for energy, and push your scrapyard walls outward to uncover more.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/261ffa7b53264cc47dc03787d728e03d.poster.avif?t=1751971172\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/261ffa7b53264cc47dc03787d728e03d.webm?t=1751971172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/261ffa7b53264cc47dc03787d728e03d.mp4?t=1751971172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular Automation:</strong>\u00a0Snap together conveyors, extractors, printers, and refiners to build flexible production chains. Deploy new, higher-capacity units to boost your output as you grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/553887cdd5577e161d9963b91113d574.poster.avif?t=1751971172\" width=600 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/553887cdd5577e161d9963b91113d574.webm?t=1751971172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/553887cdd5577e161d9963b91113d574.mp4?t=1751971172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/2b1795fa68b09ac3580bf30f2a88b956.poster.avif?t=1751971172\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/2b1795fa68b09ac3580bf30f2a88b956.webm?t=1751971172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/2b1795fa68b09ac3580bf30f2a88b956.mp4?t=1751971172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break Walls and Expand:</strong>\u00a0Smash through buried walls to reveal hidden caves packed with scrap. Reinforce and convert them into usable build zones to grow your automation network.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/74425545b1b6da6017147544ff8e3d55.poster.avif?t=1751971172\" width=600 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/74425545b1b6da6017147544ff8e3d55.webm?t=1751971172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/74425545b1b6da6017147544ff8e3d55.mp4?t=1751971172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terminal-Based Gameplay:</strong>\u00a0Connect, configure, and control every unit through a clean text interface using real command syntax.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/8c44e6ac31f37ecb07a57eb0da41cb74.poster.avif?t=1751971172\" width=600 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/8c44e6ac31f37ecb07a57eb0da41cb74.webm?t=1751971172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/8c44e6ac31f37ecb07a57eb0da41cb74.mp4?t=1751971172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Tech Tree:</strong>\u00a0Blueprints are discovered, not unlocked. Scan and disassemble scrap to uncover hidden designs and expand your build options.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/f30345b89a92fe41a670e5dbf1b2e80e.poster.avif?t=1751971172\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/f30345b89a92fe41a670e5dbf1b2e80e.webm?t=1751971172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/f30345b89a92fe41a670e5dbf1b2e80e.mp4?t=1751971172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buried Cargo</strong> is a first-person automation game where you interact with the world entirely through a terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone maintenance robot waking up inside a buried shipping container, deep beneath the remains of a forgotten civilization. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use realistic terminal commands to connect to conveyor units, printers, extractors, and scanners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up production lines, expand your small base, and unlock blueprints buried in layers of broken tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own automation network from the inside out, not through a cluttered UI, but with a clean, readable command line.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Scrap Mining:</strong>\u00a0Forget ore veins, every scrap block hides a random mix of materials. Extract what you need, burn the rest for energy, and push your scrapyard walls outward to uncover more.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/261ffa7b53264cc47dc03787d728e03d.poster.avif?t=1751971172\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/261ffa7b53264cc47dc03787d728e03d.webm?t=1751971172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825840/extras/261ffa7b53264cc47dc03787d728e03d.mp4?t=1751971172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular Automation:</strong>\u00a0Snap together conveyors, extractors, printers, and refiners to build flexible production chains. Deploy new, higher-capacity units to boost your output as you grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vid